# Workbooks Cloud — dashboard

The control panel for your hosted autopoet. One `client` island (this file) — the shell + routing across
the eight surfaces (Overview · Usage · Integrations · Channels · Secrets · Team · Billing · Domains). It
reads the control plane over `/api/platform` with your native session cookie (`Nexus.Auth.Session`); no
session ⇒ the API answers 401 and the island bounces to `/login/`. No build step — the nexus serves the
`.work` island + `app.css` + `app.js` verbatim. Design + surfaces are specified in `cloud/SPEC.md`.

client :app do
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
  <meta name="darkreader-lock">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./app.css?v=5">

  <div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><span class="a1"></span><span class="a2"></span><span class="a3"></span></div>

  <!-- SSR paints a centered spinner on the first byte; app.js replaces #root with the live shell
       (same paper background, so no flash). -->
  <div id="root"><div class="center"><div class="spin"></div></div></div>

  <script src="./app.js?v=5"></script>
end
